WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.559
The read needs three permissions, each
the least-privileged for its call:

2
00:00:04.559 --> 00:00:09.142
one to read the public key infrastructure,
one to read the authentication

3
00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:13.050
method policy, and one to read
policies, for Conditional Access.

4
00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:16.430
The code reads the newer
PKI trust store on purpose,

5
00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:22.062
because the older configuration's delegated
read names only Global Administrator.

6
00:00:22.062 --> 00:00:26.655
One judgment call: a root CA with
no CRL is a warning, not a finding,

7
00:00:26.655 --> 00:00:31.425
because a root that issues only
CA certificates may publish none.

8
00:00:31.425 --> 00:00:36.770
Learn's prerequisite is wider, so Lab
2 confirms the root's revocation path.
